# Dependabot — kit submodule (consumer repos)

When the kit is vendored as a git submodule, keep it on platform tags:

```yaml
# .github/dependabot.yml (snippet)
version: 2
updates:
  - package-ecosystem: gitsubmodule
    directory: /
    schedule:
      interval: weekly
    allow:
      - dependency-name: tools/genetic-ai-starter
```

After Dependabot opens a PR, run:

```bash
node tools/genetic-ai-starter/scripts/doctor.mjs --target .
node tools/genetic-ai-starter/scripts/validate-installed.mjs --target .
```

Or use the composite action: `genetic-ai-starter/actions/validate/action.yml`.
